00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.710
I'd like to sink my teeth into it, too.

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:49.470
Even now, when I visit home, 
I always go out to eat this.

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:50.970
Next time: "Chicken on the Bone."
